# Chandra, Spark Hunter, cast on turn 1 with Black Lotus and a Mountain. Her 0 makes a 3/2 colorless Vehicle artifact token (loyalty
# stays 4). It is not a creature (CR 301.7), so on its own it could neither attack nor be blocked. At the beginning of combat on
# Bot1's turn her trigger targets it: until end of turn it is an artifact creature with haste (the token came this turn, so haste
# is what lets it attack), and it hits Bot2 for 3. On turn 3 it is back to a noncreature artifact (the effect ended at the end of
# turn 1) until combat of turn 3 again.

